 on Arteriosclerosis, Thrombosis and Vascular Biology; Council on Cardiovascular Radiology and Intervention; Council on Lifestyle and Cardiometabolic Health; and Council on Peripheral Vascular Disease.", "authorList": {"author": [{"fullName": "O'Sullivan JW", "lastName": "O'Sullivan", "firstName": "Jack W", "initials": "JW", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-3629-2546"}}, {"fullName": "Raghavan S", "lastName": "Raghavan", "firstName": "Sridharan", "initials": "S"}, {"fullName": "Marquez-Luna C", "lastName": "Marquez-Luna", "firstName": "Carla", "initials": "C"}, {"fullName": "Luzum JA", "lastName": "Luzum", "firstName": "Jasmine A", "initials": "JA", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-3639-717X"}}, {"fullName": "Damrauer SM", "lastName": "Damrauer", "firstName": "Scott M", "initials": "SM"}, {"fullName": "Ashley EA", "lastName": "Ashley", "firstName": "Euan A", "initials": "EA"}, {"fullName": "O'Donnell CJ", "lastName": "O'Donnell", "firstName": "Christopher J", "initials": "CJ"}, {"fullName": "Willer CJ", "lastName": "Willer", "firstName": "Cristen J", "initials": "CJ"}, {"fullName": "Natarajan P", "lastName": "Natarajan", "firstName": "Pradeep", "initials": "P", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-8402-7435"}}, {"collectiveName": "American Heart Association Council on Genomic and Precision Medicine; Council on Clinical Cardiology; Council on Arteriosclerosis, Thrombosis and Vascular Biology; Council on Cardiovascular Radiology and Intervention; Council on Lifestyle and Cardiometabolic Health; and Council on Peripheral Vascular Disease"}]}, "authorIdList": {"authorId": [{"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-8402-7435"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-3629-2546"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-3639-717X"}]}, "dataLinksTagsList": {"dataLinkstag": ["altmetrics"]}, "journalInfo": {"issue": "8", "volume": "146", "journalIssueId": 3410975, "dateOfPublication": "2022 Aug", "monthOfPublication": 8, "yearOfPublication": 2022, "journal": {"medlineAbbreviation": "Circulation", "title": "Circulation", "essn": "1524-4539", "issn": "0009-7322", "nlmid": "0147763", "isoabbreviation": "Circulation"}, "printPublicationDate": "2022-08-01"}, "pubYear": "2022", "pageInfo": "e93-e118", "abstractText": "Cardiovascular disease is the leading contributor to years lost due to disability or premature death among adults. Current efforts focus on risk prediction and risk factor mitigation' which have been recognized for the past half-century. However, despite advances, risk prediction remains imprecise with persistently high rates of incident cardiovascular disease. Genetic characterization has been proposed as an approach to enable earlier and potentially tailored prevention. Rare mendelian pathogenic variants predisposing to cardiometabolic conditions have long been known to contribute to disease risk in some families. However, twin and familial aggregation studies imply that diverse cardiovascular conditions are heritable in the general population. Significant technological and methodological advances since the Human Genome Project are facilitating population-based comprehensive genetic profiling at decreasing costs. Genome-wide association studies from such endeavors continue to elucidate causal mechanisms for cardiovascular diseases. Systematic cataloging for cardiovascular risk alleles also enabled the development of polygenic risk scores. Genetic profiling is becoming widespread in large-scale research, including in health care-associated biobanks, randomized controlled trials, and direct-to-consumer profiling in tens of millions of people. Thus, individuals and their physicians are increasingly presented with polygenic risk scores for cardiovascular conditions in clinical encounters. In this scientific statement, we review the contemporary science, clinical considerations, and future challenges for polygenic risk scores for cardiovascular diseases. We selected 5 cardiometabolic diseases (coronary artery disease, hypercholesterolemia, type 2 diabetes, atrial fibrillation, and venous thromboembolic disease) and response to drug therapy and offer provisional guidance to health care professionals, researchers, policymakers, and patients.", "publicationStatus": "ppublish", "language": "eng", "pubModel": "Print-Electronic", "pubTypeList": {"pubType": ["research-article", "Review", "Journal Article"]}, "grantsList": {"grant": [{"agency": "NHLBI NIH HHS", "acronym": "HL", "grantId": "R01 HL109946", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "NHLBI NIH HHS", "acronym": "HL", "grantId": "T32 HL007824", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "NHLBI NIH HHS", "acronym": "HL", "grantId": "K08 HL146990", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "NHGRI NIH HHS", "acronym": "HG", "grantId": "U01 HG011719", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "CSRD VA", "acronym": "CX", "grantId": "IK2 CX001780", "orderIn": 0}]}, "meshHeadingList": {"meshHeading": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Humans"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "Cardiovascular Diseases", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "DI", "qualifierName": "diagnosis"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "GE", "qualifierName": "genetics"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "EP", "qualifierName": "epidemiology"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "Diabetes Mellitus, Type 2"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Genetic Predisposition to Disease"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Risk Factors"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Multifactorial Inheritance", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "GE", "qualifierName": "genetics"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Adult"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "American Heart Association"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Genome-Wide Association Study"}]}, "keywordList": {"keyword": ["Atrial fibrillation", "Venous Thromboembolism", "Multifactorial Inheritance", "Genome-wide Association Studies", "Predictive Genetic Testing", "Aha Scientific Statements", "Diabetes, Type 2"]}, "subsetList": {"subset": [{"code": "IM", "name": "Index Medicus"}]}, "fullTextUrlList": {"fullTextUrl": [{"availability": "Open access", "availabilityCode": "OA", "documentStyle": "pdf", "site": "Unpaywall", "url": "https://www.ahajournals.org/doi/pdf/10.1161/CIR.0000000000001077"}, {"availability": "Subscription required", "availabilityCode": "S", "documentStyle": "doi", "site": "DOI", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1161/CIR.0000000000001077"}, {"availability": "Free", "availabilityCode": "F", "documentStyle": "html", "site": "Europe_PMC", "url": "https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC9847481"}, {"availability": "Free", "availabilityCode": "F", "documentStyle": "pdf", "site": "Europe_PMC", "url": "https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC9847481?pdf=render"}, {"availability": "Free", "availabilityCode": "F", "documentStyle": "doi", "site": "DOI", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1161/cir.0000000000001077"}]}, "isOpenAccess": "N", "inEPMC": "Y", "inPMC": "Y", "citedByCount": 344, "hasReferences": "Y", "hasTextMinedTerms": "Y", "hasDbCrossReferences": "N", "hasPDF": "Y", "hasBook": "N", "hasSuppl": "N", "hasLabsLinks": "Y", "hasData": "N", "authMan": "Y", "epmcAuthMan": "N", "nihAuthMan": "Y", "manuscriptId": "NIHMS1861266", "hasTMAccessionNumbers": "N", "dateOfCompletion": "2022-08-24", "dateOfCreation": "2022-07-21", "dateOfRevision": "2025-07-28", "electronicPublicationDate": "2022-07-18", "firstPublicationDate": "2022-07-18", "firstIndexDate": "2022-07-22", "fullTextReceivedDate": "2025-02-04", "embargoDate": "2023-08-23", "hasEvaluations": "N"}]}}